00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.050
<b>Muromi-san on the Shore</b>

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.050
<b>Episode 9
"Muromi-san and the Secret Advanced Civilization"</b>

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:14.110
Is that shell on your 
left side a compact?

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.940
It's like a compact and accessory case.

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:20.060
Like, I normally keep this brush in here.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.490
