advanced technology.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.670
Is stuff like that common in the sea?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.220
I wouldn't say common.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:24.070
There's this guy who likes 
making stuff like this.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.600
I had him make mine.

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:27.680
Your phone too?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.420
Yeah.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.130
One guy's making all this stuff?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.190
Well, there's not that many of us.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.810
I've told you about the Mu 
continent before, right?

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:37.820
<i>Omega Breath!</i>

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.770
The people of Mu used 
their super-science to try

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.610
