with humans since then.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.560
I think all the mysteries of 
the ancient civilizations

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.300
would be solved if I met that guy.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.930
So who is he?

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.980
